        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma gin meno gityeko timone, ludito gubino bota gutitta ni, “Jo Icrael, ajwagi, kacel ki Lulevi, pud peya gupokke woko ki i kom jo mukene ma gibedo i lobo-nu me bedo kengi ki pi tim me kipyedagi jo Kanaan, jo Kit, jo Periji, jo Jebuc, jo Ammon, jo Moab, jo Ejipt, ki jo Amor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Co ma gin Lujudaya gubedo ka nyomo anyiragi mogo gubedo mongi kikomgi ki mon pa litinogi; omiyo kwa jo maleŋ pa Lubaŋa guribbe woko kacel ki jo mukene ma gibedo i lobo-nu ma gin jo maraco. Ludito ma giloyo lwak kacel ki rwodi aye gubedo lubal madoŋo i lok man.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka awinyo lok meno, ci ayeco ginarukana woko, ka aputo yer wiya ki i wiya ki dok aputo yer tika ki i tika bene, acako bedo ma piny orem kweda woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen jo ducu ma komgi omyel ka guwinyo lok pa Lubaŋa pa Icrael, pi ŋayo waŋ Lubaŋa ma jo ma gudwogo ki i opii gubedo kwede, ci gucako gurre guruma woko dyere ma abedo ma piny orem kweda woko nio wa i kare ma gityero gitum me otyeno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno ma gityero gitum me otyeno en aye aa woko kwede ki ka ma onoŋo abedo ka ri kec iye-ni, ma ginarukana ducu guyec woko, ka arumo coŋa piny ma atano ciŋa bot Rwot Lubaŋana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kun awacce ni, “Ai Lubaŋa, lewic maka mada me ilo wiya ka atye i nyimi, ai Lubaŋana, pien bal ma wan watimo odurre madit lipim ma kato wiwa woko, ki alii mewa otorre madit lipim malo oo wa i polo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cakke i kare pa kwarowa nio wa kombeddi wan ki lwakki wabedo ka timo lwak bal mapol, Doŋ pi balwa, omiyo wan ki lukerwa, ki ajwagiwa yam gimiyowa i Ciŋ luker ma i lobo pa lurok, ginekowa ki pala lucwan, ki i rok kunnu giyakowa, dok gitimowa ki tim me lewic, macalo watye i kare man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento pi kare manok keken Rwot Lubaŋawa, kica omaki i komwa, ci imiyo jo mukene ki i kinwa gubwot dok gubedo i kabedo maleŋ-ŋi mot maber. Lubaŋawa iweko wabwot ki i opii dok imiyowa kwo manyen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo wan opii, ento in Lubaŋawa pe yam iwekowa ata i kare ma watye i opii, Dok inyuto mar meri ma pe lokke i nyim luker me Percia, omiyo guwekowa makwo dok guye ni wager ot pa Lubaŋawa odoco, ki yubo jami muballe i oburre, gumiyo gigwokowa bene maber i Judaya ki i Jerucalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kombeddi ai Lubaŋawa, wan dok wawaco aao ki i ŋe lok man mutyeko timme-ni? Doŋ wabwoto lubo cikki woko ducu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gin cik ma yam iciko dok imiyo owok ki i dog luticci ma lunebi, kun iwacci, ‘Lobo ma wubidonyo iye ka camone me bedo mewu matwal-li, en aye lobo pa jo ma komgi ki keni, pien jo ma gibedo iye gupoŋo lobo meno woko ki tim me kipyeda nia tuŋcel nio kwede i agik lobo tuŋcel dok gubedo jo ma komgi ki keni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.11+EXO.34.12+EXO.34.13+EXO.34.14+EXO.34.15+EXO.34.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 34.11-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.1+DEU.7.2+DEU.7.3+DEU.7.4+DEU.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 7.1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumiyo wun pe wumi litinogi gunyom anyirawu, ki litinowu bene pe gunyom anyiragi, wun pe myero wuyeny kuc ki lonyogi ma gitye kwede; wek wubed jo matego, ki dok wucam gin maber ma i lobo, ma wubiweko bene bot litinowu me bedo ginaleyagi matwal.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen i ŋe lok magi ducu ma opoto i komwa pi balwa ma watimogi ki pi alii madit ma watiŋo, kadi bed in, ai Lubaŋawa ineno maber, ci doŋ iketo can i komwa manok ma pe oporo lwak bal ma watimo, dok ikonyowa omiyo wabwot watye makwo-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wan dok pud wabituro cikki aye kun wamedde ki nyom i kinwa ki jo ma gitiyo bal kipyeda-ni? Ka watimo meno, kiniga pe bimaki i komwa matek nio ka Ityekowa ducu, ma dano mo acel i kinwa pe bibwot? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai Rwot Lubaŋa pa Icrael, in iporre, pien imiyo wabwot ki i lak to. Nen, watuco bal aliiwa boti, pe watye ki kit twero mo me cuŋ i nyimi pi bal man.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
